# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values locally. .env is
# git-ignored — never commit it. See SECURITY.md for what's safe to put
# here versus what must stay server-side.
#
# Nothing below is wired up yet — the app currently uses local mock state
# only (see README). These are placeholders for when real auth/backend
# integration is added (Supabase, Firebase Auth, or Auth0 recommended —
# see SECURITY.md). Only ever put publishable/anon keys here, never a
# service-role or secret key: this app ships as a static bundle, so
# anything in a VITE_-prefixed variable is compiled into the public
# JavaScript and readable by anyone.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
